Organizational Use

Any use by or on behalf of an Organization requires a separate
commercial license from Linyao Digital Studio.

"Organization" includes, without limitation:

- companies and businesses;
- sole proprietorships acting in a business capacity;
- educational institutions;
- schools and universities;
- laboratories and research institutions;
- government agencies;
- nonprofit organizations;
- associations and foundations.

A student or employee using the Software independently does not
become an Organizational Use solely because they are affiliated
with an Organization.

Use commissioned, directed, funded, deployed, or operated by an
Organization is Organizational Use.